The accepted contract is unambiguous: macOS v1 allows at most one active approved record, replacement is a new complete snapshot generation, and the decision order is unsupported → revoked → approved → first use → changed. The existing recovery work violates only the first invariant and its tests/logbook claim; I’m narrowing the correction to that contract mismatch while preserving the pre-auth fail-closed implementation.
